        403.3453369140625,
        82.56494140625
      ],
      "text": "5.\t Treatment options for latent",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 24.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.3700942993164,
        75.58094787597656,
        331.04290771484375,
        106.56494140625
      ],
      "text": "tuberculosis infection",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 24.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        182.26649475097656,
        508.5865173339844,
        194.54049682617188
      ],
      "text": "Isoniazid monotherapy for 6 months is recommended for treatment of LTBI in both adults and children",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        194.2649688720703,
        490.7855224609375,
        206.53897094726562
      ],
      "text": "in countries with high and low TB incidence.  (Strong recommendation, high-quality evidence. Existing",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        206.26344299316406,
        166.43931579589844,
        218.53744506835938
      ],
      "text": "recommendation)",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        223.9334259033203,
        511.4033508300781,
        236.20742797851562
      ],
      "text": "Rifampicin plus isoniazid daily for 3 months should be offered as an alternative to 6 months of isoniazid",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        235.93190002441406,
        506.5896301269531,
        248.20590209960938
      ],
      "text": "monotherapy as preventive treatment for children and adolescents aged < 15 years in countries with a",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        247.89236450195312,
        443.38519287109375,
        260.2043762207031
      ],
      "text": "New recommendation high TB incidence.  (Strong recommendation, low-quality evidence.  )",
      "font": "Whitney-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37869262695312,
        265.600341796875,
        474.1651916503906,
        277.8743591308594
      ],
      "text": "Rifapentine and isoniazid weekly for 3 months may be offered as an alternative to 6 months of",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37869262695312,
        277.59881591796875,
        509.7684020996094,
        289.8728332519531
      ],
      "text": "isoniazid monotherapy as preventive treatment for both adults and children in countries with a high TB",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37869262695312,
        289.5592956542969,
        452.315185546875,
        301.8713073730469
      ],
      "text": "New recommendation incidence.  (Conditional recommendation, moderate-quality evidence.  )",
      "font": "Whitney-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.378662109375,
        307.26727294921875,
        492.7994384765625,
        319.5412902832031
      ],
      "text": "The following options are recommended for treatment of LTBI in countries with a low TB incidence",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.378662109375,
        319.2657470703125,
        493.56036376953125,
        331.5397644042969
      ],
      "text": "as alternatives to 6 months of isoniazid monotherapy: 9 months of isoniazid, or a 3-month regimen",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.378662109375,
        331.2642517089844,
        484.8202819824219,
        343.53826904296875
      ],
      "text": "of weekly rifapentine plus isoniazid, or 3–4 months of isoniazid plus rifampicin, or 3–4 months of",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.378662109375,
        343.26275634765625,
        491.28326416015625,
        355.5367736816406
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin alone.  (Strong recommendation, moderate–high-quality evidence. Existing recommendation)",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03565979003906,
        360.894775390625,
        511.1383972167969,
        373.206787109375
      ],
      "text": "Remark:  Rifampicin- and rifapentine-containing regimens should be prescribed with caution to people living with",
      "font": "Whitney-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03565979003906,
        372.9312744140625,
        330.9337158203125,
        385.2052917480469
      ],
      "text": "HIV who are on ART because of potential drug–drug interactions.",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.378662109375,
        390.6012878417969,
        502.7336120605469,
        402.87530517578125
      ],
      "text": "In settings with high TB incidence and transmission, adults and adolescents living with HIV who have",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.378662109375,
        402.59979248046875,
        489.7442626953125,
        414.8738098144531
      ],
      "text": "an unknown or a positive TST and are unlikely to have active TB disease should receive at least 36",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.378662109375,
        414.5982971191406,
        490.2962341308594,
        426.872314453125
      ],
      "text": "months of IPT, regardless of whether they are receiving ART. IPT should also be given irrespective",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.378662109375,
        426.5968017578125,
        493.663818359375,
        438.8708190917969
      ],
      "text": "of the degree of immunosuppression, history of previous TB treatment and pregnancy.  (Conditional",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.378662109375,
        438.5953063964844,
        348.9323425292969,
        450.86932373046875
      ],
      "text": "recommendation, low-quality evidence. Existing recommendation)",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03565979003906,
        456.2273254394531,
        488.7818908691406,
        468.5393371582031
      ],
      "text": "Remark:  People living with HIV in settings with high TB incidence and transmission, regardless of their TST",
      "font": "Whitney-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03565979003906,
        468.2638244628906,
        512.2744140625,
        480.6898193359375
      ],
      "text": "status, obtain more benefit from IPT for   36 months than for 6 months. Those with a positive TST have a greater  ≥",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03565979003906,
        480.2623291015625,
        492.6463928222656,
        492.5363464355469
      ],
      "text": "protective benefit and those receiving ART have a significant additional benefit from longer-term IPT. Use of",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03565979003906,
        492.2608337402344,
        487.6655578613281,
        504.53485107421875
      ],
      "text": "TST is encouraged whenever feasible, but it is not a prerequisite for IPT. People with a negative TST should",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03565979003906,
        504.25933837890625,
        495.0216064453125,
        516.5333251953125
      ],
      "text": "not receive 36 months of IPT. Settings with high TB incidence and transmission should be defined by national",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03565979003906,
        516.2578735351562,
        452.4150085449219,
        528.5318603515625
      ],
      "text": "authorities, taking into consideration the local epidemiology and transmission of both TB and HIV.",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        533.4291381835938,
        500.8672180175781,
        544.9490966796875
      ],
